<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 30.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.98    1.86</p>
<p> 3   MT Leyshon Gold	10.00    2.50</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.90    0.99</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	   9.78    0.93</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.77    1.67</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.58    1.06</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 9   Spotless Svc	    9.40    1.17</p>
<p>10   Villa World	     9.40    1.17</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.99    2.17</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 8.91    1.16</p>
<p>13   Gandel Retail Tr	8.86    0.88</p>
<p>14   Barclays Mirvac	 8.40    1.31</p>
<p>15   Advance Pro CB	  8.35    1.39</p>
<p>16   Gen Prop Tr	     8.34    2.41</p>
<p>17   Schroder Prop	   8.22    2.25</p>
<p>18   Westfield Trust	 8.13    2.41</p>
<p>19   Natl In Prop	    7.96    1.05</p>
<p>20   Caltex Aust	     7.91    4.17</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
